meta {
  name: Get Polar v4 token
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: https://auth.polar.com/oauth/token
  body: formUrlEncoded
  auth: basic
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
  Accept: application/json
}

auth:basic {
  username: {{client_id}}
  password: {{client_secret}}
}

body:form-urlencoded {
  grant_type: authorization_code
  code: h0s5FB
  redirect_uri: {{redirect_uri}}
}

docs {
  Обмен authorization code на access + refresh token Polar API v4.
  
  1. Открой в браузере (подставь свой client_id):
  
     https://auth.polar.com/oauth/authorize?client_id=CLIENT_ID&response_type=code&scope=training_sessions:read sports:read&redirect_uri=http://localhost:8765/callback
  
  2. Скопируй `code` в `authorization_code` (10 минут, один раз).
  3. Отправь запрос. В `.polar_token` допиши:
  
     POLAR_V4_ACCESS_TOKEN=...
     POLAR_V4_REFRESH_TOKEN=...
  
  Access token живёт 12 часов, дальше — запрос Refresh Polar v4 token.
}
